    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Click a Dock icon to open or return to an app.

    The red button closes
    the app; right-click its icon for Close App or Quit.


    A dot means the app
    is running. Minimizing keeps it running; closing removes its dot and menu context.


    Drag
    windows freely. Double-click a title bar to fill; the green button enters full
    screen.


    Enable Dock auto-hide in Settings, then move the pointer to the
    bottom edge to reveal it.'
